vi /etc/init.d/documentum
At the end of the STARTUP Scripts add the following line
/bin/su - zdcd01 -c /dctm_app/dba/jon/src/rhq-agent/bin/rhq-agent-wrapper.sh start

At the Shutdown Section 
Add line before JMS shutdown line
/bin/su - zdcd01 -c /dctm_app/dba/jon/src/rhq-agent/bin/rhq-agent-wrapper.sh stop


